    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross prior year reserve strengthening of GBP 40.5 million for 2018, representing 1.39% of opening gross reserves. This strengthening was primarily driven by adverse claims development in Property and Casualty lines, including significant strengthening during 2017 across multiple UK and International classes. This was partially offset by favourable claims development in Marine and Aviation lines, which saw an improvement to prior accident year performance. Uncertainties regarding property catastrophe claims, repair cost inflation, and changes in law were also noted as potential drivers of reserve movements. Reinsurance recoveries, including a net gain of GBP 26 million from an Adverse Development Cover (ADC) and a loss portfolio transfer, impacted the net position.",
